{
  "description": "在一份授权 PDF/DOCX/PPTX 或文本材料中按原文字面量检索，软件按需准备缓存，不必先提取。可指定 pages；省略时分批扫描，nextCursor 配合同一原材料/query 续扫。返回真实页/段落、短上下文、缺口与未读页段；未扫描、图片或提取失败不冒充没有命中。用 material.read 回读命中表示。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "attachmentId": {
        "format": "uuid",
        "pattern": "^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "cursor": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "limit": {
        "default": 20,
        "maximum": 100,
        "minimum": 1,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "pages": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "from": {
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "to": {
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991,
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "from",
          "to"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "query": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "attachmentId",
      "query"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "read",
    "label": "检索材料",
    "targetKinds": []
  },
  "name": "material.find",
  "version": 1
}
